    <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="precedence__helpers_8c_1a82257daed03cfa14c82bd5633e865dd2" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="structParserStackEntry" kindref="compound">ParserStackEntry</ref> *</type>
        <definition>ParserStackEntry * parser_top_terminal</definition>
        <argsstring>(const Stack *stack, int line)</argsstring>
        <name>parser_top_terminal</name>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="structStack" kindref="compound">Stack</ref> *</type>
          <declname>stack</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>line</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Najde terminal nejblize vrcholu zasobniku. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Prochazi zasobnik od vrcholu hloubeji pomoci parser_stack_peek a vrati prvni zaznam, ktery je terminal. Tento zaznam se pouzije k indexaci precedencni tabulky a v pripade potreby se do nej vepise znacka redukce. Na dne zasobniku je vzdy terminal $, funkce proto nema selhat; pokud zadny terminal nenajde, jde o internich chybu (ERR_INTERNAL).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stack</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Zasobnik parseru. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>line</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Cislo radku pro chybova hlaseni. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Ukazatel na zaznam s terminalem nejblize vrcholu, nikdy NULL. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="src/precedence_helpers.c" line="22" column="18" bodyfile="src/precedence_helpers.c" bodystart="22" bodyend="36"/>
      </memberdef>
      <memberdef kind="function" id="precedence__helpers_8c_1a12c239e8d3d7e93eff6dfa614703ac0b" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void parser_build_handle</definition>
        <argsstring>(const Stack *stack, SearchHandle *handle, int line)</argsstring>
        <name>parser_build_handle</name>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="structStack" kindref="compound">Stack</ref> *</type>
          <declname>stack</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="structSearchHandle" kindref="compound">SearchHandle</ref> *</type>
          <declname>handle</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>line</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Sestavi handle ze zasobniku. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Projde zasobnik od vrcholu hloubeji az po prvni zaznam se znackou redukce (reduction_marker); tento zaznam do handle nepatri. Pokud je handle delsi nez HANDLE_MAX_LENGTH, program skonci syntaktickou chybou (ERR_SYNTAX), pokud se znacka na zasobniku vubec nenajde, jde o internich chybu (ERR_INTERNAL). Symboly se do handle ukladaji v prirozenem poradi zleva doprava, tedy od nejhloubeji ulozeneho symbolu (handle-&gt;symbols[0]) po symbol na vrcholu zasobniku, v poradi, v jakem je ocekava redukcni tabulka. Prazdny handle (znacka primo na vrcholu) funkce nekontroluje, resi ho reduction_table_lookup.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stack</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Zasobnik parseru. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>handle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Handle, ktery se sestavi, nesmi byt NULL. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>line</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Cislo radku pro chybova hlaseni. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
