      <memberdef kind="function" id="precedence__helpers_8c_1abe74eee758fffad8ce6b89a212b35559" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="precedence__helpers_8h_1ac9519d0e8446d2baa06969328a4b254f" kindref="member">PredictorValue</ref></type>
        <definition>PredictorValue parser_evaluate_predictor</definition>
        <argsstring>(Token *token, PredictorValue predictor)</argsstring>
        <name>parser_evaluate_predictor</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="structToken" kindref="compound">Token</ref> *</type>
          <declname>token</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="precedence__helpers_8h_1ac9519d0e8446d2baa06969328a4b254f" kindref="member">PredictorValue</ref></type>
          <declname>predictor</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Vyhodnoti predikci operatoru a operandu pro vstupni token. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Pokud je na vstupu ID a je predpovidan operator, zmeni se typ tokenu na TOKEN_ID_OPERATOR (atribut tokenu zustava). Pokud je na vstupu TOKEN_PLUS nebo TOKEN_MINUS ze scanneru a je predpovidan operand, zmeni se typ tokenu na TOKEN_PLUS_UNARY resp. TOKEN_MINUS_UNARY. Nova predikce se pak urci podle tokenu: po ), ID, INT_LIT, DOUBLE_LIT, STRING_LIT, true a false se predpovida operator, jinak operand. ID prepsane na ID_OPERATOR je operator, takze po nem nasleduje operand; nezmenene ID je operand, po nem nasleduje operator. Po + a - (binarnich i unarnich) nasleduje vzdy operand.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>token</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Vstupni token, muze byt zmenen z TOKEN_ID na TOKEN_ID_OPERATOR, z TOKEN_PLUS na TOKEN_PLUS_UNARY nebo z TOKEN_MINUS na TOKEN_MINUS_UNARY. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>predictor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Soucasna hodnota predikce. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Nova hodnota predikce. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
